  title: Upanishads
  text: The Upanishads, over a hundred in number with about thirteen principal ones, explore the self, or atman, ultimate reality, or brahman, karma and liberation. They form Vedanta, the end of the Vedas. India's motto, Satyameva Jayate, comes from the Mundaka Upanishad.
